# 🌐 Synapse Query Cost & Performance Monitor
Welcome to the interactive operational workspace portal. Use this app to easily audit query logs and track compute chargebacks.

### 🧭 How to Navigate:
1. **Set Infrastructure Scope (Cell 1):** Select your target **Pool Name** and choose your desired **Time Range** history windows, then hit the run button on that cell.
2. **Select Target User (Cell 2):** Use the dynamic **View User** and **Query Status** dropdowns to instantly isolate specific operational events.
3. **Analyze Results (Cell 3):** View the live KPI summaries. Toggle between **Table View** (to read raw SQL command scripts) and **Chart View** (to track financial chargeback graphs).
